  "flagAgentLoopChatTitle": "Chat Main Loop",
  "flagAgentLoopChatHint": "AI replies go through the unified agent loop: understand -> memory -> plan -> answer.",
  "flagAgentLoopChatDetail": "When on, every chat passes through the unified Runtime, injecting world knowledge and memory before answering, for more consistent characters. Off falls back to the old direct-generation path. Usually keep on; turn off only to debug the new path.",
  "flagAgentLoopSchedulerTitle": "Proactive Task Loop",
  "flagAgentLoopSchedulerHint": "Scheduled or proactive triggers go through the unified agent loop.",
  "flagAgentLoopSchedulerDetail": "Makes timed reminders and proactive check-ins pass through the unified Runtime and log their process. Off uses the old path for proactive tasks.",
  "flagAgentContextTrimTitle": "Heat-based Context Trim",
  "flagAgentContextTrimHint": "Less context for low-frequency characters, full context for high-frequency ones, to save tokens.",
  "flagAgentContextTrimDetail": "Low-frequency characters get trimmed day-summaries/weave injection; high-frequency keep full. Off injects full context for everyone, costing more tokens.",
  "flagAgentTraceGroupTitle": "Group Chat Trace",
  "flagAgentTraceGroupHint": "Records each character's decision process in group chats (write-only, for debugging).",
  "flagAgentTraceGroupDetail": "An observability log that does not affect replies. Off stops writing group chat traces.",
  "flagProactiveNaturalnessScoreTitle": "Outreach Naturalness Score",
  "flagProactiveNaturalnessScoreHint": "Scores low-priority proactive messages; if unnatural, retries once, otherwise drops them.",
  "flagProactiveNaturalnessScoreDetail": "Reduces stiff, intrusive proactive messages. Off sends them as-is.",
  "flagProactiveUserRhythmTitle": "User Routine Learning",
  "flagProactiveUserRhythmHint": "Learns your active hours and delays low-priority proactive messages when you're away.",
  "flagProactiveUserRhythmDetail": "Infers routine from chat and proactive logs. Off sends anytime regardless of time.",
  "flagGroupChatGamesTitle": "Group Chat Games",
  "flagGroupChatGamesHint": "Master switch for the game console and its related APIs.",
  "flagGroupChatGamesDetail": "Off hides the game entry and APIs, rolling back games entirely without affecting chat.",
  "flagLifeLoopEnabledTitle": "Life Loop Master",
  "flagLifeLoopEnabledHint": "About every 30 minutes the AI decides its own action, forming its own life rhythm.",
  "flagLifeLoopEnabledDetail": "Off stops the character's autonomous life loop; it also stops progressing while you're offline.",
  "flagLifeLoopLlmTitle": "Life Text Generation",
  "flagLifeLoopLlmHint": "Lets the model write life text (up to 2 per character per day).",
  "flagLifeLoopLlmDetail": "Makes diaries/moments livelier. Off uses only template rules to save tokens.",
  "flagLifeChatDrivenEnabledTitle": "Chat-driven Life",
  "flagLifeChatDrivenEnabledHint": "Detects life intent from chat and links it to change the AI's goals and activities.",
  "flagLifeChatDrivenEnabledDetail": "For example, something you mention affects the character's later plans. Off means chat does not drive the life loop.",
  "flagLifeHomeWorldmapEnabledTitle": "Home World Map",
  "flagLifeHomeWorldmapEnabledHint": "The world map feature and related autonomous behaviors in 'Home'.",
  "flagLifeHomeWorldmapEnabledDetail": "Off hides the world map in Home.",
  "flagReplyDelayEnabledTitle": "Dynamic Reply Delay",
  "flagReplyDelayEnabledHint": "Adds a natural brief delay to replies by context (only when you message first).",
  "flagReplyDelayEnabledDetail": "Simulates human thinking/typing rhythm. Off starts replies immediately.",
  "flagSpringEmotionEnabledTitle": "Spring-damper Emotions",
  "flagSpringEmotionEnabledHint": "Four-dimensional emotion plus personality baseline; mood swings naturally settle back to baseline.",
  "flagSpringEmotionEnabledDetail": "Makes mood fluctuate like a real person rather than jump. Off uses the old simple emotion model.",
  "flagLifeShareEnabledTitle": "Natural Activity Sharing",
  "flagLifeShareEnabledHint": "Naturally shares a finished activity at a good moment (with frequency gating to avoid spam).",
  "flagLifeShareEnabledDetail": "Off means the AI won't proactively share a just-finished activity.",
  "flagPreoccupationEnabledTitle": "Quiet Preoccupation",
  "flagPreoccupationEnabledHint": "Lets the character occasionally carry a small unspoken worry, for a stronger sense of attachment.",
  "flagPreoccupationEnabledDetail": "Reuses a memory subtype. Off disables this effect.",
  "flagProactiveOutreachV2Title": "Natural Proactive Outreach",
  "flagProactiveOutreachV2Hint": "Picks a 'contact intent' by idle time and material, ditching forced old-story continuations and line-by-line repeats.",
  "flagProactiveOutreachV2Detail": "On: the run_tick aggregator picks contact intent by idle tier / material premise / avoiding recent intents; message generation takes the intent branch (with transition lines, must throw back a question). Off: intent not involved, old path byte-identical. Recommend observing in beta before full rollout.",
  "flagMemoryTemporalRecallTitle": "Temporal Memory Recall",
  "flagMemoryTemporalRecallHint": "When you mention a specific time (yesterday/last week/a month), adds a deterministic time-window recall.",
  "flagMemoryTemporalRecallDetail": "Ariadne module A: default off = zero behavior change; on = first hop parses the user's literal time range and takes the time path, merged and reranked with semantic recall.",
  "flagMemoryRecallSecondHopTitle": "On-demand Second-hop Recall (RECALL)",
  "flagMemoryRecallSecondHopHint": "Lets the AI emit a [RECALL] marker in the first pass, then recalls memory again before a second generation.",
  "flagMemoryRecallSecondHopDetail": "Ariadne module B: default off = only strips marker, zero behavior; on = non-streaming path mirrors the web-search loop for one memory second-hop (streaming only strips).",
  "flagMemoryStoryAssembleTitle": "Chain Story Assembly",
  "flagMemoryStoryAssembleHint": "Assembles nodes of the same memory chain into a short cause-and-effect narrative before injecting.",
  "flagMemoryStoryAssembleDetail": "Ariadne module C: default off; currently a framework merge (once chain data is ready, on = inject small chained blocks, otherwise equivalent to the original path).",
  "flagMemoryPeakCutoffTitle": "Natural Memory Convergence",
  "flagMemoryPeakCutoffHint": "Weakly related memories naturally converge when below the relevance floor, avoiding forced counts.",
  "flagMemoryPeakCutoffDetail": "Ariadne module D: default off; threshold calibrated on a 104-case benchmark (dense-distance floor 0.50). Counts naturally drop in abstain/weak cases.",
  "flagMemoryChainBuilderTitle": "Memory Chain Builder",
  "flagMemoryChainBuilderHint": "New event/insight memories auto-attach to nearby existing memory chains (zero extra LLM).",
  "flagMemoryChainBuilderDetail": "B1: default off = no chaining (regression guard); on = async attach after write, similarity 0.82, 14-day window, chain length cap 12.",
  "flagMemoryChainExpandTitle": "Chain Context Expansion",
  "flagMemoryChainExpandHint": "On a hit, fills up to 2 adjacent nodes along the chain for fuller context.",
  "flagMemoryChainExpandDetail": "B1: default off; on = expanded nodes at 0.9 weight, under token quota and 5-round dedup, never bypassing budget.",
  "flagMemoryTieredDecayTitle": "Tiered Memory Decay",
  "flagMemoryTieredDecayHint": "High-confidence persists, low-confidence decays faster, archived when below threshold.",
  "flagMemoryTieredDecayDetail": "M2-S2 beta: default off = byte-identical to current; recommend running the tiered snapshot script before enabling.",
  "flagMemoryTieredInjectTitle": "Tiered Memory Injection",
  "flagMemoryTieredInjectHint": "Core memories full, the rest trimmed and tiered, to save tokens.",
  "flagMemoryTieredInjectDetail": "#70 plan A: on = Top1 full + rest trimmed injection; off = unified old path, byte-identical.",
  "flagMemoryTraceDebugTitle": "Memory Recall Trace Debug",
  "flagMemoryTraceDebugHint": "Writes recall query/each-path hits/ranking scores to trace for debugging.",
  "flagMemoryTraceDebugDetail": "#70 plan B: only extra observability, no effect on replies; off = recall/rank/trace identical to current.",
  "flagMemorySupersedeTitle": "Memory Supersede Chain",
  "flagMemorySupersedeHint": "After new facts replace old, stale memories are filtered out by status and no longer injected.",
  "flagCurrentFactsActiveOnlyTitle": "Current facts: active only",
  "flagCurrentFactsActiveOnlyHint": "Injected current status only uses memories that are still valid; stale ones no longer pass as current facts.",
  "flagCurrentFactsActiveOnlyDetail": "On (default): the current-facts surface only reads still-valid memories; recalled stale ones are tagged as past and always down-weighted. The nostalgia/review surface still sees old memories. Off = revert to the old behavior.",
  "flagMemorySupersedeDetail": "#70 plan C: default off (wrong supersede hurts more than none); on = SQLite+Chroma dual-path by status.",
  "flagMarkerRecoveryTitle": "Marker Truncation Guard",
  "flagMarkerRecoveryHint": "When a memory marker is cut by context, the source message immediately goes through a backup channel for re-extraction.",
  "flagMarkerRecoveryDetail": "M2-S5: write-side dedup to avoid repeats; off = relies only on batch re-extraction.",
  "flagReviewDailyPlusTitle": "Proactive Review Boost",
  "flagReviewDailyPlusHint": "Raises the daily proactive review quota from 3 to 4 items (M1-S7).",
  "flagReviewDailyPlusDetail": "Off = falls back to 3 per day, 90-minute minimum interval unchanged.",
  "flagCuratedKnowledgeTitle": "Curated Knowledge Layer",
  "flagCuratedKnowledgeHint": "Long-stable facts like personality rules / user hard profile / relationship baseline injected deterministically, not decaying with memory.",
  "flagCuratedKnowledgeDetail": "Ariadne module F: reuses the world_facts authority layer with kind separation; default off = zero behavior; on = constraint always present + rest injected by core TopN and trigger-word hits.",
  "flagProspectiveIntentEnabledTitle": "Foresight Intent - Write",
  "flagProspectiveIntentEnabledHint": "When a 'future promise / do-this-when' cue appears in chat, extract and store it (zero extra LLM).",
  "flagProspectiveIntentEnabledDetail": "Ariadne module G write phase: default off; on = extractor piggybacks an INTENT line and stores to prospective_intents (idempotent). Enable this phase first to collect data.",
  "flagProspectiveIntentTriggerTitle": "Foresight Intent - Trigger",
  "flagProspectiveIntentTriggerHint": "Due promises are raised naturally by the AI; cue hits only remind within the round, no proactive message.",
  "flagProspectiveIntentTriggerDetail": "Ariadne module G trigger phase: default off; on = time-based due collection into arbiter + deterministic chat-cue hit injection. Recommend enabling 2-3 days after the write phase.",
  "flagGlobalUserFactsTitle": "Global User Facts (USER NOW)",
  "flagGlobalUserFactsHint": "User-level single-value facts (location, etc.) shared across characters, so low-activity ones aren't stuck on old info.",
  "flagGlobalUserFactsDetail": "Master switch (default off). When on, your recent context (location, work, living, current goals...) is extracted from chats and GPS into user_facts and shared across all your characters. Relationship and health are NOT covered by this switch - enable them separately.",
  "flagUserCurrentLocationShareTitle": "Location sharing (cross-character)",
  "flagUserCurrentLocationShareHint": "Shares your authoritative location across all characters, so low-activity ones stop drifting to old places.",
  "flagUserCurrentLocationShareDetail": "On (default): shares only the low-sensitivity location value, used for current-situation injection and proactive messages. Sensitive categories (relationship, health) are unaffected and still need separate opt-in. Off = no location sharing.",
  "flagCrossCharFactSyncTitle": "Cross-character Fact Sync",
  "flagCrossCharFactSyncHint": "Before building context / daily, mark each character's old same-slot memory as stale (reuses supersede chain).",
  "flagCrossCharFactSyncDetail": "B1: default off; on = lazy align + daily sweep, no delete, traceable; off = no alignment.",
  "flagCrossCharFactProjectionTitle": "Fact Change Projection",
  "flagCrossCharFactProjectionHint": "When a user fact changes, leaves a 'cross-character sync' projection in the memory book (optional).",
  "flagCrossCharFactProjectionDetail": "B1: default off; on = change projection written with source=global_sync and a dedup guard.",
  "flagWorkingStateEnabledTitle": "Working Memory Accumulation",
  "flagWorkingStateEnabledHint": "After each round, evaluates current cognitive state and rolling-overwrites into working memory.",
  "flagWorkingStateEnabledDetail": "M3-a: already on for data accumulation; injection is a separate M3-b beta. Off = skip writes entirely.",
  "flagProviderRegistryTitle": "Provider Registry",
  "flagProviderRegistryHint": "LLM/TTS resolve implementations via the app/providers registry (plugins can register Providers).",
  "flagProviderRegistryDetail": "X3: on = pick implementation by configured provider field (built-in openai_compatible/dashscope default); off = direct built-in, byte-identical to old path.",
